- TS joins follow relative specifiers only; tsconfig path aliases and package imports stay unjoined (counted unresolved). A re-export chain (`export { X } from './abi'`) is not followed.
- A Go ABI held in a `var` of another file (not a const) is not a GoStringConst and stays unjoined. abigen MetaData vars live beside their methods, so this is rare.
